# TEST FIXTURE (id 225): the legendary encounters (contract section 52). Not part of the game: reached only by the host harness (tools/host_world, `make legend`).
# Three zones side by side, one legendary bird of the overworld each (the actors of tools/legend_ow.py), the species is an existing one (muncrit) because the real ones come with C7 / C9:
#   * the ice corner (i 0..9, slabs) with Aurowl's actor `A` (5,7), legend=muncrit level=40, the spawn `start` (2,7) facing E
#   * the metal corner (i 10..18) with Fulgurion's actor `F` (14,7), spawn `metal` (12,7); the rock corner (i 19..27) with Ignicondor's actor `I` (23,7), spawn `rock` (21,7)
#   (the ice floor of Islas Escarcha does not exist yet: the light slabs stand in for it, the metal slabs are the power plant's, the cave floor is the rock)
@map test_legend
@size 28 16
@interior no
@bg 0
@spawn start 2 7 NE
@spawn metal 12 7 NE
@spawn rock 21 7 NE
@legend
  a  tile=slab_00
  b  tile=slab_01
  c  tile=slab_10
  d  tile=slab_11
  e  tile=metal_00
  f  tile=metal_01
  g  tile=metal_10
  h  tile=metal_11
  .  tile=cave_a
  A  tile=slab_11 legend=muncrit level=40 npc=aurowl_ow face=SW
  F  tile=metal_11 legend=muncrit level=45 npc=fulgurion_ow face=SW
  I  tile=cave_a legend=muncrit level=50 npc=ignicondor_ow face=SW
